 "description": "Tenant A and tenant B send requests under one session id and thread. A's second request must be priced against A's first: hot, a read of 10,000 tokens, no break. Under the current key (session + thread) B's request replaces A's ThreadState, so A's second request would be compared with B's 22,000-token body and show a break that is nobody's.",
 "source": "issue_cases.md#501",
